# English exercise characterization (R1.1). Recorded once by a dump of the shipped en-ru engine (the JSON path before R1.13..R1.17), not an independent linguistic oracle.
# Same CASE shape as requirements.core-data (pl): 16 skills x 2 draw vectors (random seed pick), 12 seeds x 5 chain steps.
# A later difference is a RED to investigate, never an edit of this file. Generated test: TrainingParityEnTest.kt (generate-exercise-oracle-test.py).
CASE {id: "C-01-01" kind: chain input: {seed: {nounId: "wife" adjectiveId: "beautiful"} step: 1} context: {randomDraws: [0.11] drawsUsed: 0} exercise: {id: "generated" primarySkill: "en:role.object" source: "Here is my beautiful wife." prompt: "Скажи, что видишь этот предмет. Начни с «I see…»." expected: "I see my beautiful wife." explanation: "Роль меняется (подлежащее → дополнение), форма слова остаётся прежней." changes: [{from: "my beautiful wife" to: "my beautiful wife" reason: "Роль меняется (подлежащее → дополнение), форма слова остаётся прежней."}] nounId: "wife" adjectiveId: "beautiful" possessive: "my" number: "sg" tags: ["obj"] accepted: []}}
CASE {id: "C-01-02" kind: chain input: {seed: {nounId: "wife" adjectiveId: "beautiful"} step: 2} context: {randomDraws: [0.22] drawsUsed: 0} exercise: {id: "generated" primarySkill: "en:verb.pastSimple" source: "I see my beautiful wife." prompt: "Перенеси предложение в прошедшее время." expected: "I saw my beautiful wife." explanation: "Меняется время глагола: настоящее → прошедшее, дополнение не меняется." changes: [{from: "see" to: "saw" reason: "Меняется время глагола: настоящее → прошедшее, дополнение не меняется."}] nounId: "wife" adjectiveId: "beautiful" possessive: "my" number: "sg" tags: ["past"] accepted: []}}
CASE {id: "C-01-03" kind: chain input: {seed: {nounId: "wife" adjectiveId: "beautiful"} step: 3} context: {randomDraws: [0.33] drawsUsed: 0} exercise: {id: "generated" primarySkill: "en:polarity.past" source: "I saw my beautiful wife." prompt: "Сделай предложение отрицательным, сохранив прошедшее время." expected: "I did not see my beautiful wife." explanation: "Добавлен did not перед базовой формой глагола." changes: [{from: "saw" to: "did not see" reason: "Добавлен did not перед базовой формой глагола."}] nounId: "wife" adjectiveId: "beautiful" possessive: "my" number: "sg" tags: ["neg" "past"] accepted: []}}
